  "messages": [
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.5274,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.75,
      "sequenceNumber": 1,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "OK so we need to design a REST API for a food delivery app. Let me start.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:00:05.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.4659,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.625,
      "sequenceNumber": 2,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "First, we need a users endpoint. POST /api/users for registration, GET /api/users/:id for profile.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:00:20.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.4253,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5682,
      "sequenceNumber": 3,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Then restaurants. GET /api/restaurants for listing, GET /api/restaurants/:id for details, POST /api/restaurants for adding new ones.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:00:40.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": -1,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.5206,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 4,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "That makes sense.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:00:55.000Z",
      "userId": "user_meera",
      "userName": "Meera"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.5398,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 5,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "For orders, we need POST /api/orders to create, GET /api/orders/:id to track, PUT /api/orders/:id/status to update.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:01:15.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.445,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.675,
      "sequenceNumber": 6,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "The menu should be nested under restaurants. GET /api/restaurants/:id/menu returns the full menu.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:01:35.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": -1,
      "messageType": "agreement",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.4488,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.6429,
      "sequenceNumber": 7,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Yeah, that's right.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:01:50.000Z",
      "userId": "user_anil",
      "userName": "Anil"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": -1,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.5584,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 8,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "For authentication, JWT tokens. Login returns a token, every subsequent request includes it in the Authorization header.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:02:10.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": -1,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.5888,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 9,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Payment integration would be POST /api/payments with the order ID and payment method. Stripe or Razorpay.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:02:30.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": -1,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.3662,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.85,
      "sequenceNumber": 10,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Sounds good to me.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:02:45.000Z",
      "userId": "user_priya",
      "userName": "Priya"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": -1,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.5642,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 11,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "For real-time tracking, we could use WebSockets. The delivery person sends location updates, and the customer gets them in real-time.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:03:05.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.5276,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.7,
      "sequenceNumber": 12,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "The order status flow would be: placed → confirmed → preparing → picked_up → delivered.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:03:25.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "question",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.5904,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.7,
      "sequenceNumber": 13,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "What about cancellation? Can users cancel after the order is confirmed?",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:03:45.000Z",
      "userId": "user_meera",
      "userName": "Meera"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "question",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.6536,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.6167,
      "sequenceNumber": 14,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Good question. Cancel should only work before 'preparing' status. POST /api/orders/:id/cancel with a check on current status.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:04:05.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.5662,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 15,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "We also need ratings. POST /api/orders/:id/rating after delivery. Rating for both restaurant and delivery person.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:04:25.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "question",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.4246,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 16,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Search endpoint: GET /api/restaurants/search?q=pizza&lat=28.7&lng=77.1&radius=5km",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:04:45.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 1,
      "messageType": "question",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.3705,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.55,
      "sequenceNumber": 17,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Should we use geospatial queries for that? Like MongoDB's $near?",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:05:05.000Z",
      "userId": "user_anil",
      "userName": "Anil"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 1,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.4356,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.925,
      "sequenceNumber": 18,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Yes, MongoDB with 2dsphere index would work perfectly for location-based search. Good point Anil.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:05:25.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": -1,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.4087,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.4667,
      "sequenceNumber": 19,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "For the response format, every API should return { success: boolean, data: {}, error: string }. Consistent structure.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:05:45.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.4159,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 20,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Pagination for listings: GET /api/restaurants?page=1&limit=20&sort=rating. Default limit 20, max 50.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:06:05.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "question",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.4718,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 21,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "What about filtering restaurants by cuisine type?",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:06:25.000Z",
      "userId": "user_priya",
      "userName": "Priya"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "question",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.3692,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 22,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Add it as query param: GET /api/restaurants?cuisine=indian&veg=true&priceRange=low. Multiple filters.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:06:45.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": -1,
      "messageType": "question",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.2967,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.725,
      "sequenceNumber": 23,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Rate limiting is important too. 100 requests per minute per user. 429 Too Many Requests if exceeded.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:07:05.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 0,
      "messageType": "agreement",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.4999,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 24,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "For the delivery person app, separate endpoints: GET /api/delivery/available-orders, POST /api/delivery/accept/:orderId.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:07:25.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": -1,
      "messageType": "question",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.3943,
      "sentimentLabel": "positive",
      "sentimentScore": 0.65,
      "sequenceNumber": 25,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Should delivery persons have their own authentication or share the same system?",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:07:45.000Z",
      "userId": "user_meera",
      "userName": "Meera"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 2,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.592,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5,
      "sequenceNumber": 26,
      "source": "text",
      "text": "Same JWT system but with role-based access control. Roles: customer, restaurant_owner, delivery_person, admin.",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T14:08:05.000Z",
      "userId": "user_raj",
      "userName": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "clusterLabel": 2,
      "messageType": "building on idea",
      "messageTypeConfidence": 0.2905,
      "sentimentLabel": "neutral",
      "sentimentScore": 0.5938,
      "sequenceNumber": 27,
